<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xri version="1.0">
   <description>
      <p>
        TGScripts - PixInsight scripts provided by Thorsten Glebe.
     </p>
   </description>
   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.6:1.9.99">
      <package fileName="TGScripts_repository.tar.gz" sha1="6206c1de3d0a9feb2cbee7a6e100417b2cd3b3f8" type="script" releaseDate="20261111">
         <title>
            TGScripts - protected file saves and image moves
         </title>
         <remove>
            src/scripts/TGScripts
            doc/scripts/AberrationInspectorTG
            doc/scripts/AberrationSpotterTG
            doc/scripts/AstroBucketList
            doc/scripts/BBStarReduction
            doc/scripts/ColorMaskTG
            doc/scripts/CSTG
            doc/scripts/DarkStructureEnhanceTG
            doc/scripts/DeconvolutionPreviewTG
            doc/scripts/LinearMasterBlend
            doc/scripts/LocalSupportMask
            doc/scripts/LRGBDeconvolutionMatch
            doc/scripts/ROILinearFit
            doc/scripts/StarSpikeProtectionMask
            doc/scripts/SubframeQualityReview
            doc/scripts/TGScriptSkeleton
            doc/scripts/EmissionLineIntegrationTG
            doc/scripts/TGFieldMosaic
            doc/scripts/TGCornerMosaic
            doc/scripts/TGHueRangeMask
            doc/scripts/TGDustContrast
            doc/scripts/TGPSFComparison
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
               Image processing, imaging-target planning and subframe review tools for PixInsight. This package requires PixInsight 1.9.6 or later.
            </p>
            <p>
               New script names: AberrationInspectorTG is now TG Field Mosaic 2.3.0; AberrationSpotterTG is now TG Corner Mosaic 2.3.0; ColorMaskTG is now TG Hue Range Mask 2.3.0; DarkStructureEnhanceTG is now TG Dust Contrast 2.5.0; DeconvolutionPreviewTG is now TG PSF Comparison 2.4.0.
               Menu entries, filenames and help guides use the new names. Recreate saved process icons that reference the former script filenames.
            </p>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List 0.35.2: Collection saves, backups and temporary preview writes now reject PixInsight installation paths and unsafe filesystem aliases. Verified file replacement preserves linked original contents and retains recovery data if a save cannot be restored. SIMBAD lookups and DSS survey previews remain available.
            </p>
            <p>
               Subframe Quality Review 0.55.3: Reviewed WBPP exports, move/undo journals, rejected-original moves and restores now check source and destination locations before changing files. Temporary measurement and recommendation locations are checked as well. Original-image moves continue to require explicit confirmation.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updated help pages describe permitted file locations, temporary replacement and recovery files, and the read-only Windows volume query used to detect alternate drive mappings. Use direct local paths on Windows; network shares, substituted drives and redirected paths are refused. The package deploys only TGScripts code, signatures and compiled script documentation in their designated directories.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
</xri>
